      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>Re-try the operation that led to this error when the device regains connectivity. Remote provisioning of keys requires reaching the remote server, and the device is currently unable to due that due to lack of network connectivity. This value is returned when isTransientFailure() is true.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/security/KeyStoreException#RETRY_WHEN_CONNECTIVITY_AVAILABLE" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.security.KeyStoreException.RETRY_WHEN_CONNECTIVITY_AVAILABLE</code>.</a></format></para>
